<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT in 0.50 peso div on convertible stock.</title>
<headline>PLDT in 0.50 peso div on convertible stock.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT) said on Wednesday its board had declared a 0.50 peso cash dividend on convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>The dividend will be for the six months ending October 31, 1996 and will be payable on November 29 to shareholders on record as of October 24.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will cover series C, D, J and T, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
